            "notes": "I prefer [Scientific Deathod](item_d61c724d-0a3e-4a28-bfb5-a7859b799981) here since it will allow you to get to ultimate quite fast, by fading through enemies. It also gives 81 non-diminishing Overhealth for each enemy you fade through. [Empowering You](item_d4d9b084-65c6-4f90-90b2-664157d28aeb) can be good here too, if you have a super aggressive tank or DPS that pumps out damage. For our perk we get [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) as this reduces the cool down for your [Cross-Orbal](item_e567bb63-527f-4c72-8ba1-dc59be1a0dc1). Unfortunately not our fade.. at least as it is now.\n\n*If you do not have enough for [Biotech Maximizer](item_01c6dcb3-d2e2-4c57-bd21-61d7b8f939c4) here, pick up any of the optional you can afford.",
